=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Surface\" title=\"SG Surface\">SG_Surface</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Caustic_Brine\">Sources of Caustic Brine</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Brine\" title=\"Caustic Brine\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp/45px-Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp/60px-Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Caustic Brine\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Caustic_Brine_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Brine\" title=\"Caustic Brine\">Caustic Brine</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nature%27s_Vengeance\" title=\"Nature's Vengeance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nature's Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></pi